    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- How to play --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Connect 3 or more numbers, such as 1, 2, 3, in descending order, then release your finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The connected numbers will rearrange themselves in the order they are linked and merge into a single number greater than the last one connected (for instance, tracing 1, 2, 3 will result in a merged number of 4).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can connect circles whether they're touching or slightly apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Additionally, you can connect the numbers in descending order, such as 4, 3, 2, 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Remember to connect the numbers one at a time, following their order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples of Valid and Invalid Moves:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [1, 2, 3, 4]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [2, 3, 4]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [3, 2, 1]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1, 2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1, 2, 4, 5]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1,2,3,2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When no more numbers can be connected, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Feature --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- With no time limit, you can enjoy the game at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience gameplay free from flashy distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of the BGM and the satisfying sound effects when tracing or generating numbers, designed to relax and enchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge players from around the globe in the score rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's easy to dive into, but once you start, you'll find it hard to stop.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- How to play --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Connect 3 or more numbers, such as 1, 2, 3, in descending order, then release your finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The connected numbers will rearrange themselves in the order they are linked and merge into a single number greater than the last one connected (for instance, tracing 1, 2, 3 will result in a merged number of 4).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can connect circles whether they're touching or slightly apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Additionally, you can connect the numbers in descending order, such as 4, 3, 2, 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Remember to connect the numbers one at a time, following their order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples of Valid and Invalid Moves:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [1, 2, 3, 4]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [2, 3, 4]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valid: [3, 2, 1]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1, 2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1, 2, 4, 5]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invalid: [1,2,3,2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When no more numbers can be connected, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Feature --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- With no time limit, you can enjoy the game at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience gameplay free from flashy distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immerse yourself in the tranquil beauty of the BGM and the satisfying sound effects when tracing or generating numbers, designed to relax and enchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenge players from around the globe in the score rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's easy to dive into, but once you start, you'll find it hard to stop.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blending the simple rule of sequentially tracing numbers with the trendy concept of 'physics puzzles' makes this game an irresistibly addictive experience!",
